[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u30FC\u3093\u3002\u7D76\u597D\u306E\u63A1\u53D6\u65E5\u548C\uFF01\n\u660E\u65E5\u306E\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3068\u306E\u4F9D\u983C\u306B\u5411\u3051\u3066\u3001\n\u304A\u76EE\u5F53\u3066\u304C\u898B\u3064\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088\u3046\u306B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm. Perfect weather for gathering!\nHoping to find what we need for tomorrow\u0027s\nrequest with Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\uFF01\u3000\u898B\u3066\u304F\u3060\u3055\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Ryza! Look at this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u82B1\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u5148\u8F29\u304C\n\u63A2\u3057\u3066\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u305F\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isn\u0027t this the flower Miss Ayesha\nwas looking for!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u30FC\u3002\u3061\u3087\u30FC\u3063\u3068\u9055\u3046\u304B\u3082\u3002\n\u30A2\u30FC\u30B7\u30E3\u306F\u7518\u3044\u5302\u3044\u306E\u3059\u308B\u82B1\u3060\u3063\u3066\n\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\u3053\u306E\u82B1\u306F\u5302\u3044\u304C\u3057\u306A\u3044\u3057",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... I don\u0027t think so.\nAyesha said she needed a sweet-smelling flower,\nbut this one doesn\u0027t have any scent."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305F\u3001\u78BA\u304B\u306B\uFF01\n\u672C\u3092\u8AAD\u3080\u3060\u3051\u3067\u306F\u60F3\u50CF\u3082\u3067\u304D\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068\u304C\n\u5B9F\u969B\u306E\u63A1\u53D6\u3067\u306F\u8D77\u3053\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-you\u0027re right!\nThere\u0027s so much you can only learn through\nactual gathering that books can\u0027t teach..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3042\u2026\u2026\u305B\u3063\u304B\u304F\u5148\u8F29\u304C\u305F\u306E\n\u304A\u5F79\u306B\u7ACB\u3066\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3063\u305F\u306E\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah... And here I thought I could finally\nbe of help to everyone..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u307E\u3042\u3001\u3088\u304F\u4F3C\u3066\u305F\u3057\u3002\u6B21\u3001\u6B21\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey now, it was pretty close! On to the next one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3046\u2026\u2026\u79C1\u3082\u65E9\u304F\u3001\u4E00\u4EBA\u524D\u306E\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u306B\u306A\u308A\u305F\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3002\n\u8FD1\u9053\u3063\u3066\u3001\u3042\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... I want to become a proper alchemist\nas soon as possible.\nIs there some kind of shortcut?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7D4C\u9A13\u3092\u7A4D\u307F\u307E\u304F\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keep racking up experience"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u306B\u3082\u304B\u304F\u306B\u3082\u7D4C\u9A13\u3092\u7A4D\u3080\u3053\u3068\u3060\u306D\u3002\n\u3069\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u306B\u3082\u610F\u5473\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3068\u601D\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\u6311\u6226\u3057\u3066\u307F\u308B\u2026\u2026\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The key is to build up experience.\nTry to see meaning in everything you do,\nand be willing to try anything... I think."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u6311\u6226\u2026\u2026\u4ECA\u56DE\u306E\u4F9D\u983C\u3082\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3059\u306D\u3002\n\u529B\u4E0D\u8DB3\u306A\u3093\u3066\u601D\u308F\u305A\u3001\u6311\u6226\u3057\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Try anything... Like this request.\nI can\u0027t let my shortcomings hold me back\u2014\nI have to keep trying!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u6016\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3051\u3069",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Even if it\u0027s a little scary."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52A9\u3051\u305F\u3044\u4EBA\u3092\u601D\u3044\u6D6E\u304B\u3079\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think of the people you want to help"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52A9\u3051\u305F\u3044\u4EBA\u3092\u601D\u3044\u6D6E\u304B\u3079\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u306E\u306F\u3069\u3046\uFF1F\n\u3053\u306E\u4EBA\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306B\u9811\u5F35\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3001\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3046\u3068\u3001\n\u529B\u304C\u6E67\u3044\u3066\u3053\u306A\u3044\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How about thinking of the people you want to help?\nWhen you focus on working hard for someone else\u0027s sake,\ndon\u0027t you feel more motivated?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u308F\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3059\uFF01\u3000\u7D76\u5BFE\u306B\u3084\u308A\u9042\u3052\u308B\u305E\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I know exactly what you mean! That feeling of\n\u0027I absolutely have to succeed!\u0027"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u8003\u3048\u308B\u3068\u3001\u4F9D\u983C\u3092\u53D7\u3051\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\n\u4E0A\u9054\u3078\u306E\u8FD1\u9053\u306A\u306E\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u307E\u305B\u3093",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe taking on requests is the best way\nto improve after all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5FC5\u8981\u3068\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3053\u305D\u4E00\u4EBA\u524D\u3001\u3067\u3059\u3082\u3093\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Being needed is what makes a true alchemist!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8FD1\u9053\u306A\u3093\u304B\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There are no shortcuts"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8FD1\u9053\u306A\u3093\u304B\u306A\u30FC\u3044\uFF01\n\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3082\u305D\u3046\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u7D50\u5C40\u306F\u5730\u9053\u306B\u3084\u308B\u3057\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There aren\u0027t any shortcuts!\nLike everything else,\nyou just have to put in the work."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u7A4D\u307F\u4E0A\u3052\u3066\u304D\u305F\u3082\u306E\u306F\n\u5F8C\u306B\u306A\u3063\u3066\u5FC5\u305A\u5F79\u306B\u7ACB\u3064",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But everything you build up now\nwill definitely come in handy later."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u57FA\u672C\u3042\u3063\u3066\u3053\u305D\u306E\u5FDC\u7528\u3067\u3059\u3082\u3093\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You need the basics before you can advance!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u5730\u9053\u306B\u3084\u308B\u306E\u306F\u5F97\u610F\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u304B\u3048\u3063\u3066\u5E0C\u671B\u304C\u898B\u3048\u3066\u304D\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And since I\u0027m good at methodical work,\nthis actually gives me hope!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u91CD\u8981\u306A\u306E\u306F\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u81EA\u8EAB\u3060\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3002\n\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u306E\u306F\u3001\u4EBA\u3068\u6BD4\u3079\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But remember, what matters most is being yourself, Resna.\nThe important thing is not comparing yourself to others."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3001\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, Miss Ryza!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u306D\u3001\u843D\u3061\u8FBC\u3080\u3053\u3068\u3082\n\u3042\u308B\u3060\u308D\u3046\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\u3042\u3063",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And you know, there will be times\nwhen you feel down, but... Ah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u308C\u3001\u6B32\u3057\u304B\u3063\u305F\u85AC\u8349\u3060\uFF5E\uFF01\n\u3000\u6839\u3063\u3053\u307E\u3067\u7DBA\u9E97\u306B\u63A1\u3063\u3066\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This is the medicinal herb I wanted!\nGotta make sure to get the roots cleanly...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3068\u304D\u306F\u3001\u559C\u3093\u3067\u304F\u308C\u305F\u4EBA\u306E\n\u9854\u3092\u601D\u3044\u51FA\u3059\u3068\u30FC\u2026\u2026\u3093\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "At times like that, just remember the faces\nof the people you\u0027ve helped... Hm?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u306E\u77F3\u3001\u30ED\u30ED\u30CA\u304C\u63A2\u3057\u3066\u305F\u3084\u3064\u3060\u3002\n\u3000\u5272\u308C\u3084\u3059\u3044\u3057\u3001\u5225\u306B\u3057\u3068\u3053\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(This stone is what Rorona was looking for.\nIt\u0027s fragile, better keep it separate.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\uFF5E\u3001\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u3084\u308C\u3066\u305F\u306A\uFF5E\u3063\u3066\n\u5B9F\u611F\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027ll feel that sense of accomplishment\nwhen you realize..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304A\u8A71\u3057\u4E2D\u3001\u5931\u793C\u3057\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excuse me for interrupting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3001\u306A\u306B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wh-what is it!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4ECA\u306E\u624B\u3055\u3070\u304D\u3001\u3082\u3046\u4E00\u5EA6\n\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Could you show me those hand movements\none more time!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u624B\u3055\u3070\u304D\u3063\u3066\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hand movements?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u52A9\u8A00\u306E\u6700\u4E2D\u306B\u3001\u8449\u3068\u6839\u3092\n\u4E00\u77AC\u3067\u4ED5\u5206\u3051\u3066\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3088\u306D\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "While you were giving advice, you instantly\nsorted the leaves from the roots!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u3001\u898B\u9003\u3057\u3066\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3088\uFF01\n\u571F\u306B\u7D1B\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u9271\u77F3\u3092\n\u5225\u306E\u5BB9\u5668\u306B\u5206\u3051\u3066\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And I didn\u0027t miss it!\nYou separated that ore hidden in the soil\ninto a different container!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u2026\u2026\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3053\u306E\u77ED\u6642\u9593\u306B\n\u3069\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306A\u3054\u5224\u65AD\u3092\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How did... No, what kind of judgment\ndid you make in such a short time!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4F5C\u696D\u3068\u3057\u3066\u306F\u666E\u901A\u306A\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, it\u0027s pretty normal work, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3059\u304C\u3001\u9A5A\u7570\u7684\u306A\u901F\u5EA6\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But your speed is incredible!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u3046\u3059\u308C\u3070\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u306E\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3001\n\u3066\u304D\u3071\u304D\u4F5C\u696D\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "How can I work as efficiently\nas you do, Miss Ryza!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8D77\u3053\u308A\u3046\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u60F3\u5B9A\u3057\u3066\u304A\u304F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anticipate what might happen"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8D77\u3053\u308A\u3046\u308B\u3053\u3068\u3092\u60F3\u5B9A\u3057\u3066\u304A\u304F\u306E\u304C\n\u5927\u4E8B\u304B\u306A\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think it\u0027s important to anticipate\nwhat might happen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u4E88\u7FD2\u3068\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u79C1\u3082\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You mean like preparation?\nBut I already do that..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3061\u3087\uFF5E\u3063\u3068\u9055\u3046\u304B\u306A\u3002\n\u4F3C\u305F\u85AC\u8349\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3068\u304B\u3001\u4FDD\u5B58\u306B\u9069\u3057\u305F\u5BB9\u5668\u3092\n\u77E5\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308C\u3070\u3001\u8FF7\u3046\u6642\u9593\u304C\u6E1B\u308B\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s a bit different. If you know about similar herbs\nor which containers work best for storage,\nyou won\u0027t waste time hesitating."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u78BA\u304B\u306B\uFF01\u3000\u9B54\u7269\u907F\u3051\u3092\u7528\u610F\u3057\u3066\u3001\n\u7121\u7528\u306A\u6226\u3044\u3092\u907F\u3051\u308B\u2026\u2026\u3068\u304B\u3082\u3067\u3059\u304B\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see! Like preparing monster repellent\nto avoid unnecessary battles... right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u305D\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u98F2\u307F\u8FBC\u307F\u304C\u65E9\u3044\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly! You catch on quick!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u52C9\u5F37\u306B\u306A\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01\n\u6B21\u56DE\u304B\u3089\u306F\u5FC3\u304C\u3051\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I learned so much!\nI\u0027ll keep this in mind from now on!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8AB0\u304B\u3068\u7AF6\u3044\u5408\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Compete with someone"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8AB0\u304B\u3068\u7AF6\u3044\u5408\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3092\u8003\u3048\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u65E9\u304F\u306A\u308C\u308B\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Trying to compete with someone\ncan help you get faster."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u3066\u2026\u2026\u79C1\u3068\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Do you mean... with me!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\uFF01\u3000\u9055\u3046\u9055\u3046\u3002\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306E\u5834\u5408\u306F\u3001\u5E7C\u99B4\u67D3\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! No, no. In my case,\nit was with my childhood friends."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u76EE\u6307\u3059\u65B9\u5411\u306F\u9055\u3063\u305F\u3051\u3069\u3001\n\u8CA0\u3051\u3066\u3089\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3046\u304B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even though we were heading in different directions,\nI just couldn\u0027t let myself fall behind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3063\u3068\u6210\u9577\u3057\u305F\u59FF\u3092\n\u898B\u305B\u3066\u3084\u308B\u305E\u3063\u3066\u601D\u3048\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted to show them how much\nI could grow."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3075\u3075\u3002\u79C1\u306B\u3068\u3063\u3066\u306E\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3067\u3059\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. Like Izana is for me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306F\u9A0E\u58EB\u3001\n\u79C1\u306F\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3067\u3059\u304C\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana aims to be a knight while\nI\u0027m pursuing alchemy, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5922\u3092\u53F6\u3048\u308B\u3068\u8A93\u3063\u305F\u601D\u3044\u306F\u4E00\u7DD2\u3067\u3059\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our determination to achieve our dreams\nis the same!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u671F\u65E5\u9593\u8FD1\u306B\u3084\u308B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Work right before the deadline"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u671F\u65E5\u9593\u8FD1\u306B\u3084\u308B\u3053\u3068\u304B\u306A\uFF01\n\u9593\u306B\u5408\u308F\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\u3001\u3068\u3044\u3046\u60F3\u3044\u304C\n\u901F\u5EA6\u3092\u4E0A\u3052\u3066\u304F\u308C\u308B\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe work right before the deadline!\nThat fear of not making it in time\nreally gets you moving faster!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\uFF01\u3000\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u304C\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What!? Even you, Miss Ryza!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\uFF01\u3000\u5197\u8AC7\u3060\u3063\u3066\uFF01\n\u5BB6\u306E\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u3092\u30B5\u30DC\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3082\u3001\n\u3055\u3059\u304C\u306B\u4F9D\u983C\u306F\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u3059\u308B\u3088\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha! I\u0027m kidding!\nEven though I used to skip my chores at home,\nI always take requests seriously~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u3001\u304A\u5BB6\u306E\u304A\u624B\u4F1D\u3044\u3092\n\u30B5\u30DC\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u306A\u3001\u4F55\u304B\u6DF1\u3044\u304A\u8003\u3048\u306A\u3069\u304C\u3001\u3042\u3063\u305F\u308A\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Ryza, you used to skip your chores!?\nWas there... some deep reason for that...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3001\u671F\u65E5\u9593\u8FD1\u306B\u3084\u308B\u3068\u3044\u3046\u5FC3\u7406\u306F\n\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u304F\u3082\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u2026\u2026\n\u7126\u308A\u3059\u304E\u308B\u3068\u3001\u96C6\u4E2D\u3067\u304D\u307E\u3059\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I understand what you mean about deadlines...\nThat pressure can actually help you focus."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u3042\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u304C\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u3044\u308C\u3070\u3001\n\u305D\u306E\u3046\u3061\u3067\u304D\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u306A\u308B\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, just keep being yourself, Resna.\nIt\u0027ll come naturally with time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\u2026\u2026\u9811\u5F35\u308A\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You think so...? I\u0027ll do my best!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\u3002\n\u307E\u305F\u8CEA\u554F\u653B\u3081\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I\u0027m sorry.\nI got carried away with questions again."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u3063\u3071\u308A\u3001\u3054\u8FF7\u60D1\u3067\u3057\u305F\u304B\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was I... being a bother...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u610F\u6B32\u306F\u6291\u3048\u306A\u304F\u305F\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don\u0027t hold back your enthusiasm"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5927\u4E08\u592B\u3001\u610F\u6B32\u306F\u6291\u3048\u306A\u304F\u305F\u3063\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088\u3002\n\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3001\u5206\u304B\u308B\u3082\u3093\u3002\n\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u304C\u8D70\u308A\u51FA\u3057\u3066\u3001\u6B62\u307E\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3053\u3068",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s okay, you don\u0027t need to hold back your enthusiasm.\nI understand, you know.\nThat feeling when you just can\u0027t stop yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u63A2\u7A76\u5FC3\u3092\u3001\n\u5927\u4E8B\u306B\u80B2\u3066\u3066\u3042\u3052\u3066\u3002\n\u305D\u308C\u304C\u3001\u672A\u6765\u306E\u81EA\u5206\u3092\u4F5C\u308B\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So cherish that inquiring spirit of yours, Resna.\nIt\u0027s what will shape your future self."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u2026\u2026\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\uFF01\n\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\u306B\u305D\u3046\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u3051\u308B\u3068\u3001\n\u3068\u3066\u3082\u5FC3\u5F37\u3044\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... Miss Ryza!\nHearing you say that makes me\nfeel so much stronger!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u63A2\u7A76\u5FC3\u3001\u5927\u4E8B\u306B\u306E\u3073\u306E\u3073\u3068\n\u80B2\u3066\u3055\u305B\u3066\u3044\u305F\u3060\u304D\u307E\u3059\uFF01\u3000\u3084\u30FC\u3063\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll nurture my curiosity and let it grow\nfreely! Yaaaaay!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u305D\u306E\u8ABF\u5B50\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, that\u0027s the spirit!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7DE9\u6025\u304C\u5927\u4E8B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Balance is important"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7DE9\u6025\u304C\u5927\u4E8B\u3060\u3088\u3002\n\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u8ABF\u5408\u306F\u3001\u9759\u304B\u306B\u4E01\u5BE7\u306B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Balance is important.\nOf course, synthesis requires calm and care."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u305D\u308C\u4EE5\u5916\u306F\u5143\u6C17\u3067\n\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But for everything else,\nit\u0027s fine to be energetic!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3082\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306B\u89E6\u767A\u3055\u308C\u3066\u3001\n\u7814\u7A76\u3092\u9032\u3081\u305F\u308A\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone\u0027s been inspired by your enthusiasm\nto advance their own research."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7DE9\u6025\u304C\u3042\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306B\u3088\u3063\u3066\u3001\n\u304A\u4E92\u3044\u306B\u523A\u6FC0\u3057\u5408\u3048\u308B\u826F\u3044\u95A2\u4FC2\u3092\u7BC9\u3051\u308B\u3001\n\u305D\u3046\u3044\u3046\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u304B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So with proper balance, we can create\npositive relationships that inspire each other.\nIs that what you mean!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5148\u8F29\u304C\u305F\u306E\u304A\u5F79\u306B\u7ACB\u3066\u3066\u3044\u308B\u306A\u3093\u3066\u2026\u2026\n\u79C1\u3001\u611F\u7121\u91CF\u3067\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "To think I could be helpful to everyone...\nI\u0027m overwhelmed with joy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u30FC\u3093\u3068\u3076\u3064\u304B\u3063\u3066\u3053\u3044\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come at me with everything you\u0027ve got!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3069\u30FC\u3093\u3068\u3076\u3064\u304B\u3063\u3066\u304D\u306A\u3088\uFF01\n\u5927\u4E8B\u306A\u5F8C\u8F29\u3060\u3082\u3093\u3001\u53D7\u3051\u6B62\u3081\u308B\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come at me with everything you\u0027ve got!\nYou\u0027re my precious junior, I can take it!\nSay whatever\u0027s on your mind!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u597D\u304D\u306A\u3060\u3051\u8A9E\u308A\u5012\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let it all out!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306F\u3044\u3063\uFF01\u3000\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6\u5148\u8F29\uFF01\n\u3067\u306F\u3001\u304A\u8A00\u8449\u306B\u7518\u3048\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes! Miss Ryza!\nThen, if you don\u0027t mind..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u30FC\u30FC\u30FC\uFF01\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "YAAAAAH!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 82,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3050\u3048\u3048\u3048\uFF01\u3000\u7269\u7406\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3088\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Gwaah! I didn\u0027t mean physically!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 83,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3059\u3001\u3059\u307F\u307E\u305B\u3093\uFF01\n\u65E9\u3068\u3061\u308A\u3057\u3066\u3057\u307E\u3044\u307E\u3057\u305F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I\u0027m so sorry!\nI misunderstood!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 84,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3001\u307E\u3063\u305F\u304F\u3082\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, oh you..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 85,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306B\u306D\u3002\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3082\u5E2B\u5320\u306B\u51FA\u4F1A\u3063\u3066\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u306E\u5B58\u5728\u3092\u77E5\u3063\u305F\u3068\u304D\u3001\n\u5BB6\u307E\u3067\u7A81\u6483\u3057\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You know, when I first learned about alchemy\nfrom my master, I actually barged into\ntheir house too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 86,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3054\u3001\u3054\u81EA\u5B85\u306B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Their h-house!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 87,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u5206\u304B\u308B\u3088\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3002\n\u306A\u3093\u3060\u304B\u61D0\u304B\u3057\u3044\u306A\u3041",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s why I understand how you feel.\nIt brings back memories."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 88,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306F\u3001\u305D\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u3044\u3044\u306E\u3002\n\u60F3\u3044\u306E\u307E\u307E\u306B\u3001\u7A81\u304D\u9032\u3093\u3067\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So Resna, just keep being yourself.\nFollow your passion wherever it leads."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 89,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u307E\u307E\u3067\u2026\u2026\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It\u0027s really okay... to be myself?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 90,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u71B1\u3044\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u3067\u76DB\u308A\u4E0A\u3052\u305F\u3089\u3001\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u304C\u5897\u3048\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u3057\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Maybe your enthusiasm will even inspire\nmore people to become alchemists!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 91,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u306A\u3093\u3066\u7D20\u6575\u306A\u5922\u306A\u3093\u3067\u3057\u3087\u3046\u2026\u2026\n\u5206\u304B\u308A\u307E\u3057\u305F\u3002\u4E00\u7FFC\u3092\u62C5\u3063\u3066\u307F\u305B\u307E\u3059\uFF01\n\u305D\u3057\u3066\u3044\u3064\u304B\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What a wonderful dream...\nI understand. I\u0027ll do my part!\nAnd someday..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 92,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u3082\u3001\u8AB0\u304B\u306E\u5148\u8F29\u306B\u3002\n\u305D\u3093\u306A\u65E5\u304C\u3001\u6765\u308B\u306E\u304B\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I\u0027ll be someone\u0027s senior too.\nI wonder if that day will come..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 93,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3046\u3093\u3002\u304D\u3063\u3068\u6765\u308B\u3088\u3002\n\u3000\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306F\u5F8C\u8F29\u306E\u6C17\u6301\u3061\u306B\u5BC4\u308A\u6DFB\u3048\u308B\u3001\n\u3000\u305D\u3093\u306A\u5148\u8F29\u306B\u306A\u308B\u6C17\u304C\u3059\u308B\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Yeah. It definitely will.\nI have a feeling Resna will become the kind of senior\nwho really understands her juniors\u0027 feelings.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30E9\u30A4\u30B6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]